--- !u!114 &1028768586993904934
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4530028329646035563}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ac98efaeff4b83c48a626ae5b22d32f8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableItem
  _promptMessage: Press [E] to Read
  _content: "<align=center><b><b><size=110%>THE LAST MEMORY</size></b></align>\r\n<align=center><b><b><size=100%>PHASE
    1: THE FIRST EXPOSURE</size></b></align>\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>PRE-STAGE UPGRADES</b></color>\r\n<i>(Located
    on the bench before entry. You may only choose <b>ONE</b>)</i>\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#00C8FF>Fisheye
    Optic:</color></b> Specialized camera lens providing a wider field of view and
    <b>Double Tracking Range</b> while aiming.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#00C8FF>Spectral
    Tuner:</color></b> An old radio modified to let you <b>Passively see the Shadow's
    silhouette</b> without using the camera.\r\n\r\n<voffset=0.5em><b><color=#00FFC0>THE
    OBJECTIVE</color></b>\r\nStand at the central table and <b>Hold <color=#C0C0C0>[E]</color></b>
    to fix the <b><color=#FF00FF>Fragment</color></b>. You must reach <b>100% Progress</b>
    to trigger the next phase.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>THE THREAT: THE SHADOW</b></color>\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Manifestation:</color></b> He appears at random locations.
    While he is present, the <b>Fragment Progress is LOCKED</b>. He must be banished
    to continue.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Static Cues:</color></b> Listen for
    <b>Radio Static</b>. The sound is 3D\u2014it gets louder as you get closer or
    when looking directly at his position.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Invisibility:</color></b>
    Unless you have the <b>Spectral Tuner</b>, the Shadow is invisible to the naked
    eye. You must use the <b>Viewfinder <color=#C0C0C0>[Right-Click]</color></b>
    to see him.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>The Clock:</color></b> Once the Shadow
    appears, you have <b><color=red>30 Seconds</color></b> to repel him before your
    run is terminated.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>DETECTION & DEFENSE</b></color>\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Red Indicators:</color></b> When you are near the Shadow's
    location, <b>Red Lines</b> will appear on-screen to guide your aim.\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Polaroid Flash:</color></b> To banish him, center your cursor
    on his body and <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Left-Click]</color></b> to take a photo.\r\n\u2022
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Recovery:</color></b> Once banished, there is a short window
    of safety before he can reappear. Use this time to focus entirely on the Fragment.\r\n\r\n<color=red><b>!!!
    CRITICAL ADVICE !!!</b></color>\r\n<b>Do not lose your direction.</b> There are
    <b><color=#C0C0C0>Invisible Walls</color></b> at the map edges. Focus your movement
    on the inner arena; if you get stuck against a wall during a chase, your run
    <b>will</b> end. <b>Listen, Light, and Move.</b>"
